  </p>

  <h2>2. What the service is</h2>
  <p>
    CurlToCode converts cURL commands into source code for a range of HTTP
    clients, and converts statically analysable JavaScript and TypeScript
    requests back into cURL. It is provided free of charge, with no account and
    no registration. Conversion runs in your browser; we do not receive what you
    paste.
